c_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/39/Necrotic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Necrotic\" title=\"Necrotic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-necrotic\">Necrotic</span></a> damage</li>\n<li>Does not give disadvantage on stealth checks.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Healing_Morgue\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"House of Healing Morgue\">House of Healing Morgue</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;44&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;-942</span>: Worn by the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hollow_Armour\" title=\"Hollow Armour\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Hollow_Armour.png/25px-Portrait_Hollow_Armour.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Hollow_Armour.png/38px-Portrait_Hollow_Armour.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Hollow_Armour.png/50px-Portrait_Hollow_Armour.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hollow Armour\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Portrait_Hollow_Armour.png/25px-Portrait_Hollow_Armour.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Portrait_Hollow_Armour.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hollow_Armour\" title=\"Hollow Armour\">Hollow Armour</a> at the bottom of the pit</li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This item shares a visual model with <a href=\"/wiki/Plate_Armour\" title=\"Plate Armour\">P